WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.340
Bill C-70 — Foreign Influence Transparency Registry.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.045
Zero registrations.

00:00:06.045 --> 00:00:10.863
The Countering Foreign Interference Act received Royal Assent in June 2024.

00:00:10.863 --> 00:00:16.011
The Foreign Influence Transparency Registry has been active for over 650 days.

00:00:16.011 --> 00:00:18.306
Total registrations: zero.

00:00:18.306 --> 00:00:20.693
Total enforcement actions: zero.

00:00:20.693 --> 00:00:22.829
Total charges laid: zero.

00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:27.181
Legislative History — How Bill C-70 Became Law.

00:00:27.181 --> 00:00:36.238
From the Hogue Commission in March 2023 to the NSICOP report confirming MPs wittingly assisted foreign states, to Royal Assent in June 2024.

00:00:36.238 --> 00:00:41.102
Over 650 days later — zero registrations, zero enforcement.

00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:43.931
Analysis — Why Zero Compliance?

00:00:43.931 --> 00:00:50.409
Four failure modes: self-registration design that relies on foreign agents to voluntarily expose themselves.

00:00:50.409 --> 00:00:53.261
No proactive investigation by the RCMP.

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:57.363
No consequence for non-compliance after 650 days.

00:00:57.363 --> 00:01:02.704
Political will deficit — the government that created the Registry has no incentive to enforce it.

00:01:02.704 --> 00:01:04.704
The Pattern of Non-Enforcement.

00:01:04.704 --> 00:01:15.818
Bill C-70 follows a documented institutional pattern: the government responds to public pressure by creating legislation or an inquiry, then fails to enforce the resulting framework.

00:01:15.818 --> 00:01:17.443
Legislate visibility.

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.011
Withhold enforcement.

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:20.897
Claim the problem is addressed.

00:01:20.897 --> 00:01:23.011
Connected investigation dossiers.

00:01:23.011 --> 00:01:26.636
The Hogue Commission and NSICOP findings on foreign interference.

00:01:26.636 --> 00:01:29.102
The 2025 election analysis.

00:01:29.102 --> 00:01:30.954
The federal lobbying pipeline.

00:01:30.954 --> 00:01:35.681
Cross-reference these investigations for the full picture of institutional non-enforcement.
